{
  "info": {
    "name": "MessMate API",
    "description": "MessMate - Smart Mess & Shared Housing Management Platform.\n\nLocal: http://localhost:5000 (default)\nChange the `baseUrl` collection variable to point at the deployed API.\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Run the three requests in **Auth / Login** first. Each one saves its own token into a collection variable (`adminToken`, `managerToken`, `memberToken`), so every later request is already authenticated for the right role.\n2. Run **Mess / Create mess** as the manager - it saves `messId`.\n3. Run **Member / Add member** then **Member / Get mess members** - the list saves `memberId`.\n4. The **Error cases** folder is the three-role demo: every request there is expected to fail, with the status noted in its name.\n\n## Seeded accounts\n\n| Role | Email |\n|---|---|\n| ADMIN | admin@messmate.app |\n| MESS_MANAGER | manager@messmate.app |\n| MEMBER | member@messmate.app |\n\nPasswords come from the environment file used at deploy time.\n\n## Registration is two step\n\n`POST /auth/register` does not create the account. It mails a six digit OTP and parks the signup in Redis for five minutes. `POST /auth/verify-email` with that code creates the user and returns tokens. Use the seeded accounts above for everything else, so you do not have to open a mailbox.\n\n## Response shape\n\nSuccess: `{ success, statusCode, message, data, meta? }`\nError: `{ success, statusCode, message, errors: [] }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "managerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "admin@messmate.app"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "Admin@messmate12345"
    },
    {
      "key": "managerEmail",
      "value": "manager@messmate.app"
    },
    {
      "key": "managerPassword",
      "value": "Manager@messmate12345"
    },
    {
      "key": "memberEmail",
      "value": "member@messmate.app"
    },
    {
      "key": "memberPassword",
      "value": "Member@messmate12345"
    },
    {
      "key": "messId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "otp",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirms the API is up. Returns the standard success envelope."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "404 - unknown route (envelope check)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/does-not-exist",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "does-not-exist"
              ]
            },
            "description": "An unmatched path still returns the project error envelope, not an HTML page."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (step 1 - sends OTP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tarek Islam\",\n  \"email\": \"tarek.demo@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Tarek@mess123\",\n  \"phone\": \"01700000000\",\n  \"role\": \"MEMBER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Does NOT create the user. Hashes the password, parks the signup in Redis for five minutes and mails a six digit OTP.\n\n`role` accepts only MESS_MANAGER or MEMBER. ADMIN is seeded and cannot be self registered."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify email (step 2 - creates the user)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tarek.demo@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "verify-email"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Paste the OTP from the email into the `otp` collection variable, then send. Creates the account, burns both Redis keys and returns tokens."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res?.data?.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('adminToken saved');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Saves the token into `adminToken` automatically."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Manager)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
